    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Kickin Mystic Sword</h2><p>A highly mobile mystic blade built around throws, recall, defensive control, and weapon breaking.</p><p><strong>Sundering Edge:</strong> When the wielder uses Blade Breaking Blow with this sword against a nonmagical manufactured weapon, treat that weapon as already damaged for the purpose of resolving the maneuver. The maneuver still costs its normal maneuver points, deals no damage, requires its normal save, and does not affect natural or magical weapons.</p><p>Dash, Hover Ride movement, and remote sword positioning are resolved manually where table geometry matters.</p>",
      "chat": "<p></p>"
    },
